Delete a spec from the library (and the personal registry)

Usage: akm skills delete [OPTIONS] <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>  Spec ID to delete

Options:
      --force    Skip the confirmation prompt
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
